# IgnoreActivities: answers of `/phoecord activities` and `/phoecord ignoreactivity`.
ignore_activities-none = No presence seen yet. Change your status or press Ctrl+R, then try again.
ignore_activities-line-shown = { $name } (`{ $id }`, type { $type }): shown
ignore_activities-line-hidden = { $name } (`{ $id }`, type { $type }): hidden
ignore_activities-hidden = `{ $id }` is now hidden from your status. It takes effect with your next presence update.
ignore_activities-shown-again = `{ $id }` is shown again with your next presence update.
ignore_activities-need-id = Give an application id or a game name, see `/phoecord activities`.
